  "title": "Bricks &amp; Sips",
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.buynorthernlightswines.com/products/bricks-sips-botanicals",
  "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-69fbd5da6c3a493788add55f\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/9c22d901-38c8-4114-8f83-60635e9b5807_701/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/9c22d901-38c8-4114-8f83-60635e9b5807_701/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"fdc55f7e7d8ff3aa6dba\" id=\"block-fdc55f7e7d8ff3aa6dba\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.buynorthernlightswines.com/products/bricks-sips-botanicals\" target=\"_blank\">Bricks &amp; Sips-Birds &amp; Botanicals</a></h2><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Unleash your creativity while sipping on handcrafted wine in the heart of our scenic Orchard along the banks of the Nechako River! <strong>Bricks &amp; Sips</strong> is a one-of-a-kind experience where guests can relax outdoors, take in breathtaking riverside views, and build their very own <strong>LEGO Bird or Botanical creation.</strong> Whether you're a LEGO enthusiast or just looking for a fun and interactive way to unwind, this experience is the perfect blend of play and indulgence.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Days of the Week: 7 Days a Week</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Time Slots: 11:00am, 1:00pm, 3:00pm, 5:00pm (Sunday only 11am &amp; 1pm)</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>What's new?</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We are now offering more options to choose from! Focusing on <strong>Bird Lego Kits &amp; Botanical Lego Kits.&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>What\u2019s Included?</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><em>Taxes &amp; Gratuity Included in Ticket Price</em></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Standard Adult Package - 19+ ($54)</strong>\u2022 A curated <strong>Wine Flight</strong> featuring four 2-ounce pours of our handcrafted wines<br>\u2022 A <strong>LEGO Bird or Botanical Kit</strong>\u2014<em>choose from available options upon arrival-min 5 options to choose from&nbsp;<br></em>\u2022 <strong>1.5 hours of outdoor Orchard Seating</strong> to enjoy the views while you sip and build</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">\ud83c\udf4f <strong>Non-Alcoholic Package ($47)</strong><br>\u2022 A refreshing <strong>Farming Karma Non-Alcoholic Sparkling Fruit Juice</strong><br>\u2022 A <strong>LEGO Bird or Botanical Kit</strong>\u2014<em>choose from available options upon arrival-min 5 options to choose from&nbsp;<br></em>\u2022 <strong>1.5 hours of outdoor Orchard Seating</strong> to enjoy the views while you sip and build</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">\ud83e\udd68 <strong>Snackle Box Add-On ($25)</strong><br>Enhance your experience with a delicious grazing box meant to be shared with your building buddy:<br>\u2022 Vegetable Crudit\u00e9 with Dip<br>\u2022 Two kinds of Cheese Chunks<br>\u2022 Two kinds of Sliced Meats<br>\u2022 Crackers</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">\ud83c\udf9f <strong>Booking &amp; Ticket Details</strong><br>\u2022&nbsp;<strong>All tickets must be purchased online</strong>\u2014secure your spot before they sell out!<br>\u2022 Seating is <strong>fully outdoors</strong> within our Orchard at picnic tables- <em>self-served</em><br>\u2022 <strong>Tickets are valid for the purchased date &amp; time only</strong> -<em>1.5-hour intervals but welcome to stay longer is space allows</em><br>\u2022 <strong>Seating may be shared</strong> and is not guaranteed to be private</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Come sip, build, and relax with us at <strong>Bricks &amp; Sips</strong>!</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>Not all Lego options noted within photos may be available. Minimum of 5 options will be available to choose from</em></span></p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.buynorthernlightswines.com/products/bricks-sips-botanicals\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Book here</strong></a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-fdc55f7e7d8ff3aa6dba {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-fdc55f7e7d8ff3aa6dba .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-fdc55f7e7d8ff3aa6dba {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-fdc55f7e7d8ff3aa6dba {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-fdc55f7e7d8ff3aa6dba {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-fdc55f7e7d8ff3aa6dba {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-fdc55f7e7d8ff3aa6dba .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n    \n  </style>\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
  "excerpt": "<p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Winery</strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Unleash your creativity while sipping on handcrafted wine in the heart of our scenic Orchard along the banks of the Nechako River! <strong>Bricks &amp; Sips</strong> is a one-of-a-kind experience where guests can relax outdoors, take in breathtaking riverside views, and build their very own <strong>LEGO Bird or Botanical creation.</strong> Whether you're a LEGO enthusiast or just looking for a fun and interactive way to unwind, this experience is the perfect blend of play and indulgence.</p>",
