  "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6a1f6354dde5794fd37abd24\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/9c22d901-38c8-4114-8f83-60635e9b5807_701/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/9c22d901-38c8-4114-8f83-60635e9b5807_701/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"3f8ed01797b01520be48\" id=\"block-3f8ed01797b01520be48\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Join the always-sunny Rachelle from <a href=\"https://sunsetstudio.ca\">Sunset Studio</a> for a relaxing, beginner-friendly yoga class in our Orchard! </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Booking starts June. Classes run every Monday from June to August and will take place outside in our riverside events area. Each ticket includes a glass of wine to be enjoyed before, during, or after your class. All ages are welcome to attend, but those under 19 years of age will not receive a glass of wine. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">In the event of light rain, the class will take place underneath our outdoor tented area. If there is severe weather, the class will be cancelled and tickets will be refunded.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">To purchase tickets for Yoga in the Orchard, <a href=\"https://sunsetstudio.ca/classes\">click here</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-3f8ed01797b01520be48 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-3f8ed01797b01520be48 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-3f8ed01797b01520be48 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-3f8ed01797b01520be48 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-3f8ed01797b01520be48 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-3f8ed01797b01520be48 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-3f8ed01797b01520be48 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n    \n  </style>\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
